# Caddyfile for the Amalgame Live demo.
#
# Caddy terminates TLS on :8443 with an automatic Let's Encrypt
# certificate for demo.amalgame.me, and reverse-proxies to the
# Amalgame app running in plain HTTP on 127.0.0.1:8080.
#
#   browser ──HTTPS:8443──▶ Caddy ──HTTP:8080──▶ ./server (Amalgame)
#
# ACME challenge note: the site is on a non-standard port (8443), so
# Caddy solves the certificate challenge on the standard ports — it
# needs port 80 (HTTP-01) OR port 443 (TLS-ALPN-01) reachable from the
# internet for demo.amalgame.me. Make sure at least port 80 is free
# and open in the firewall. If both 80 and 443 are taken, switch to a
# DNS-01 challenge (needs your DNS provider's API token).

demo.amalgame.me:8443 {
	encode gzip
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8080
}
